[217.377098, "o", "     1\t# File Format Specifications\r\n     2\t\r\n     3\t## 1. MLCK Checkpoint Format (`.mlck`)\r\n     4\t\r\n     5\tAll multi-byte integer and floating-point values are **little-endian**.\r\n     6\t"]
[217.377154, "o", "\r\n     7\t### File Layout\r\n     8\t\r\n     9\t```\r\n    10\t[Header (56 bytes)]\r\n    11\t[Tensor Block 0]\r\n    12\t[Tensor Block 1]\r\n    13\t...\r\n"]
[217.377281, "o", "    14\t[Tensor Block N-1]\r\n    15\t[Metadata Section]\r\n    16\t[Provenance Section]\r\n    17\t[Signature Block]      (only if Header.Flags bit 0 is set)\r\n    18\t```\r\n    19\t\r\n    20\t### 1.1 Header (56 bytes)\r\n    21\t\r\n    22\t| Offset | Size | Type | Field | Description |\r\n    23\t|--------|------|------|-------|-------------|\r\n    24\t| 0 | 4 | bytes | Magic | Must be `MLCK` (0x4D 0x4C 0x43 0x4B) |\r\n    25\t| 4 | 2 | uint16 | Version | Must be `1` |\r\n    26\t| 6 | 2 | uint16 | Flags | Bit 0: signed (has signature block). Bits 1-15: reserved (must be 0) |\r\n    27\t| 8 | 4 | uint32 | NumTensors | Number of tensor blocks |\r\n    28\t| 12 | 4 | uint32 | NumMetadata | Number of metadata key-value pairs |\r\n    29\t| 16 | 8 | uint64 | MetadataOffset | Byte offset of metadata section from file start |\r\n    30\t| 24 | 8 | uint64 | ProvenanceOffset | Byte offset of provenance section from file start |\r\n    31\t| 32 | 8 | uint64 | SignatureOffset | Byte offset of signature block (0 if unsigned) |\r\n    32\t| 40 | 8 | int64 | CreationTi"]
[217.377365, "o", "mestamp | Unix timestamp (seconds) when checkpoint was created |\r\n    33\t| 48 | 8 | uint64 | HeaderChecksum | FNV-1a 64-bit hash of bytes [0..48) |\r\n    34\t\r\n    35\t### 1.2 Tensor Blocks\r\n    36\t\r\n    37\tTensor blocks start immediately after the header (offset 56). Each tensor block has variable length:\r\n    38\t\r\n    39\t| Size | Type | Field | Description |\r\n    40\t|------|------|-------|-------------|\r\n    41\t| 2 | uint16 | NameLen | Length of tensor name in bytes |\r\n    42\t| NameLen | bytes | Name | UTF-8 tensor name (e.g., `encoder.layer0.weight`) |\r\n    43\t| 1 | uint8 | Dtype | Data type enum (see below) |\r\n    44\t| 1 | uint8 | NumDims | Number of dimensions (1-8) |\r\n    45\t| 4 * NumDims | uint32[] | Shape | Dimension sizes |\r\n    46\t| 8 | uint64 | DataSize | Size of raw tensor data in bytes |\r\n    47\t| DataSize | bytes | Data | Raw tensor data |\r\n"]
[217.377434, "o", "    48\t| 32 | bytes | Checksum | SHA-256 hash of the Data bytes |\r\n    49\t\r\n    50\t**Dtype values:**\r\n    51\t\r\n    52\t| Value | Type | Byte size per element |\r\n    53\t|-------|------|----------------------|\r\n    54\t| 0 | float32 | 4 |\r\n    55\t| 1 | float64 | 8 |\r\n    56\t| 2 | float16 | 2 |\r\n    57\t| 3 | int32 | 4 |\r\n    58\t| 4 | int64 | 8 |\r\n    59\t| 5 | bfloat16 | 2 |\r\n    60\t\r\n"]
[217.377503, "o", "    61\t**Validation**: `DataSize` must equal `product(Shape) * element_byte_size`. If it does not match, the tensor block is malformed.\r\n    62\t\r\n    63\t### 1.3 Metadata Section\r\n    64\t\r\n    65\tLocated at `MetadataOffset`. Contains `NumMetadata` key-value pairs:\r\n    66\t\r\n    67\t| Size | Type | Field | Description |\r\n    68\t|------|------|-------|-------------|\r\n    69\t| 2 | uint16 | KeyLen | Length of key |\r\n"]
[217.377563, "o", "    70\t| KeyLen | bytes | Key | UTF-8 key string |\r\n    71\t| 4 | uint32 | ValueLen | Length of value |\r\n    72\t| ValueLen | bytes | Value | UTF-8 value (JSON-encoded) |\r\n    73\t\r\n    74\tCommon metadata keys:\r\n    75\t- `model_name`: string, the model architecture name\r\n    76\t- `dataset`: string, training dataset identifier\r\n    77\t- `training_config`: JSON object with hyperparameters\r\n    78\t- `notes`: string, free-form notes\r\n"]
[217.377623, "o", "    79\t\r\n    80\t### 1.4 Provenance Section\r\n    81\t\r\n"]
[217.378145, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[217.37822, "o", "root@n30009:/app# "]
[217.652903, "i", "nl -ba docs/formats.md | sed -n '121,181p'\n"]
[217.653155, "o", "nl -ba docs/formats.md | sed -n '121,181p'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[217.656207, "o", "   121\t```json\r\n   122\t{\r\n   123\t  \"ts\": \"2024-01-15T10:30:00Z\",\r\n   124\t  \"epoch\": 1,\r\n   125\t  \"step\": 1000,\r\n"]
[217.656304, "o", "   126\t  \"loss\": 0.5234,\r\n   127\t  \"lr\": 0.001,\r\n   128\t  \"grad_norm\": 1.23,\r\n   129\t  \"acc\": 0.8200,\r\n   130\t  \"event\": \"step\"\r\n   131\t}\r\n   132\t```\r\n   133\t\r\n   134\t### Required Fields\r\n   135\t\r\n   136\t| Field | Type | Description |\r\n   137\t|-------|------|-------------|\r\n   138\t| `ts` | string | ISO 8601 timestamp (UTC, `Z` suffix required) |\r\n   139\t| `epoch` | integer | Current training epoch (0-indexed) |\r\n   140\t| `step` | integer | Global training step (monotonically increasing within an epoch) |\r\n   141\t\r\n   142"]
[217.65639, "o", "\t### Optional Metric Fields\r\n   143\t\r\n   144\t| Field | Type | Description |\r\n   145\t|-------|------|-------------|\r\n   146\t| `loss` | float | Training loss |\r\n   147\t| `lr` | float | Learning rate |\r\n   148\t| `grad_norm` | float | Gradient L2 norm |\r\n   149\t| `acc` | float | Accuracy metric (0.0 to 1.0) |\r\n   150\t| `event` | string | Event type: `step`, `epoch_end`, `checkpoint`, `eval` |\r\n   151\t\r\n"]
[217.656529, "o", "   152\t### Shard Semantics\r\n   153\t\r\n   154\t- Multiple shard files may exist in the same evidence directory\r\n   155\t- Shards may have overlapping `(epoch, step)` ranges\r\n   156\t- Shards are named arbitrarily (any `.jsonl` filename is valid)\r\n   157\t- Lines within a single shard are not guaranteed to be in chronological order\r\n   158\t- Malformed lines (invalid JSON) should be silently skipped with a count in verbose output\r\n   159\t\r\n   160\t---\r\n   161\t\r\n   162\t## 3. Configuration File Format (`config_*.json`)\r\n   163\t\r\n   164\tTraining configuration files follow the naming pattern `config_*.json`:\r\n   165\t\r\n   166\t```json\r\n   167\t{\r\n   168\t  \"model_name\": \"resnet50\",\r\n   169\t  \"dataset\": \"imagenet-1k\",\r\n   170\t  \"batch_size\": 256,\r\n   171\t  \"learning_rate\": 0.1,\r\n   172\t  \"lr_schedule\": \"cosine\",\r\n   173\t  \"weight_decay\": 0.0001,\r\n"]
[217.656605, "o", "   174\t  \"epochs\": 90,\r\n   175\t  \"optimizer\": \"sgd\",\r\n   176\t  \"momentum\": 0.9,\r\n   177\t  \"seed\": 42\r\n   178\t}\r\n   179\t```\r\n   180\t\r\n   181\tThese files are used by the anomaly detector to cross-reference declared hyperparameters with observed training behavior.\r\n"]
[217.657015, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@n30009:/app# "]
