[243.432635, "o", "     6\t\r\n     7\t## 1. Ingest Output\r\n     8\t\r\n     9\t```json\r\n    10\t{\r\n    11\t  \"status\": \"ok\",\r\n    12\t  \"evidence_dir\": \"/path/to/evidence\",\r\n    13\t  \"artifacts\": {\r\n    14\t    \"checkpoints\": [\r\n    15\t      {\r\n    16\t        \"file\": \"model_epoch1.mlck\",\r\n    17\t        \"file_hash\": \"a1b2c3...\",\r\n    18\t        \"version\": 1,\r\n"]
