[278.001257, "o", "   244\t    }\r\n   245\t  ],\r\n   246\t  \"roots\": [\"a1b2c3...\"],\r\n   247\t  \"leaves\": [\"g7h8i9...\"],\r\n   248\t  \"orphans\": [],\r\n   249\t  \"topological_order\": [\"a1b2c3...\", \"d4e5f6...\", \"g7h8i9...\"],\r\n   250\t  \"cycles\": []\r\n   251\t}\r\n   252\t```\r\n   253\t\r\n   254\t**Field rules:**\r\n   255\t- `nodes`: sorted by `creation_timestamp` ascending.\r\n   256\t- `edges`: sorted by `from` hash then `to` hash lexicographically.\r\n"]
[278.001343, "o", "   257\t- `roots`: file hashes of root nodes (no parent), sorted.\r\n   258\t- `leaves`: file hashes of leaf nodes (no children), sorted.\r\n   259\t- `orphans`: file hashes of orphan nodes (parent not found), sorted.\r\n   260\t- `topological_order`: valid topological sort of non-orphan nodes, ties broken by `creation_timestamp`.\r\n   261\t- `cycles`: if cycles exist, each cycle is a list of file hashes. Empty if DAG is valid.\r\n   262\t\r\n   263\t---\r\n   264\t\r\n   265\t## 6. Report Output\r\n   266\t\r\n   267\t```json\r\n   268\t{\r\n   269\t  \"version\": \"1.0\",\r\n"]
[278.001415, "o", "   270\t  \"generated_at\": \"2024-01-18T12:00:00Z\",\r\n   271\t  \"evidence_dir\": \"/path/to/evidence\",\r\n   272\t  \"ingest\": { ... },\r\n   273\t  \"timeline\": { ... },\r\n   274\t  \"verify\": { ... },\r\n   275\t  \"detect\": { ... },\r\n   276\t  \"lineage\": { ... }\r\n   277\t}\r\n   278\t```\r\n   279\t\r\n   280\t**Field rules:**\r\n   281\t- `version`: always `\"1.0\"`.\r\n"]
[278.001478, "o", "   282\t- `generated_at`: ISO 8601 UTC timestamp of report generation.\r\n   283\t- Each section (`ingest`, `timeline`, `verify`, `detect`, `lineage`) contains the exact same JSON structure as the corresponding standalone command output.\r\n   284\t- The report runs all analyses; if any individual analysis encounters an error, that section contains `{\"status\": \"error\", \"message\": \"...\"}` and the report still completes.\r\n   285\t\r\n   286\t---\r\n   287\t\r\n   288\t## 7. Query Output\r\n"]
[278.001539, "o", "   289\t\r\n   290\t```json\r\n   291\t{\r\n   292\t  \"status\": \"ok\",\r\n   293\t  \"query\": \"loss > 1.0 AND epoch == 3\",\r\n   294\t  \"matches\": 42,\r\n   295\t  \"entries\": [\r\n   296\t    {\r\n   297\t      \"ts\": \"2024-01-16T08:00:00Z\",\r\n   298\t      \"epoch\": 3,\r\n"]
[278.001595, "o", "   299\t      \"step\": 15000,\r\n   300\t      \"loss\": 1.234,\r\n   301\t      \"lr\": 0.0001,\r\n   302\t      \"grad_norm\": 2.1,\r\n   303\t      \"acc\": 0.75,\r\n   304\t      \"event\": \"step\",\r\n   305\t      \"sources\": [\"shard_003.jsonl\"],\r\n   306\t      \"conflict\": false\r\n   307\t    }\r\n   308\t  ]\r\n   309\t}\r\n   310\t```\r\n"]
[278.001676, "o", "   311\t\r\n   312\t**Field rules:**\r\n   313\t- `entries`: matching timeline entries sorted by `(epoch ASC, step ASC)`.\r\n   314\t- `matches`: count of matching entries.\r\n   315\t- `query`: the original query string echoed back.\r\n"]
