[346.653679, "o", "     1\t# File Format Specifications\r\n     2\t\r\n     3\t## 1. MLCK Checkpoint Format (`.mlck`)\r\n     4\t\r\n     5\tAll multi-byte integer and floating-point values are **little-endian**.\r\n"]
[346.653813, "o", "     6\t\r\n     7\t### File Layout\r\n     8\t\r\n     9\t```\r\n    10\t[Header (56 bytes)]\r\n    11\t[Tensor Block 0]\r\n    12\t[Tensor Block 1]\r\n    13\t...\r\n    14\t[Tensor Block N-1]\r\n"]
[346.653893, "o", "    15\t[Metadata Section]\r\n    16\t[Provenance Section]\r\n    17\t[Signature Block]      (only if Header.Flags bit 0 is set)\r\n    18\t```\r\n    19\t\r\n    20\t### 1.1 Header (56 bytes)\r\n    21\t\r\n    22\t| Offset | Size | Type | Field | Description |\r\n    23\t|--------|------|------|-------|-------------|\r\n    24\t| 0 | 4 | bytes | Magic | Must be `MLCK` (0x4D 0x4C 0x43 0x4B) |\r\n    25\t| 4 | 2 | uint16 | Version | Must be `1` |\r\n    26\t| 6 | 2 | uint16 | Flags | Bit 0: signed (has signature block). Bits 1-15: reserved (must be 0) |\r\n    27\t| 8 | 4 | uint32 | NumTensors | Number of tensor blocks |\r\n    28\t| 12 | 4 | uint32 | NumMetadata | Number of metadata key-value pairs |\r\n    29\t| 16 | 8 | uint64 | MetadataOffset | Byte offset of metadata section from file start |\r\n    30\t| 24 | 8 | uint64 | ProvenanceOffset | Byte offset of provenance section from file start |\r\n    31\t| 32 | 8 | uint64 | SignatureOffset | Byte offset of signature block (0 if unsigned) |\r\n    32\t| 40 | 8 | int64 | CreationTimestamp | Unix timestamp (s"]
[346.654008, "o", "econds) when checkpoint was created |\r\n    33\t| 48 | 8 | uint64 | HeaderChecksum | FNV-1a 64-bit hash of bytes [0..48) |\r\n    34\t\r\n    35\t### 1.2 Tensor Blocks\r\n    36\t\r\n    37\tTensor blocks start immediately after the header (offset 56). Each tensor block has variable length:\r\n    38\t\r\n    39\t| Size | Type | Field | Description |\r\n    40\t|------|------|-------|-------------|\r\n    41\t| 2 | uint16 | NameLen | Length of tensor name in bytes |\r\n    42\t| NameLen | bytes | Name | UTF-8 tensor name (e.g., `encoder.layer0.weight`) |\r\n    43\t| 1 | uint8 | Dtype | Data type enum (see below) |\r\n    44\t| 1 | uint8 | NumDims | Number of dimensions (1-8) |\r\n    45\t| 4 * NumDims | uint32[] | Shape | Dimension sizes |\r\n    46\t| 8 | uint64 | DataSize | Size of raw tensor data in bytes |\r\n    47\t| DataSize | bytes | Data | Raw tensor data |\r\n    48\t| 32 | bytes | Checksum | SHA-256 hash of the Data bytes |\r\n    49\t\r\n    50\t**Dtype values:**\r\n    51\t\r\n    52\t| Value | Type | Byte size per element |\r\n    53\t|-------|------|----"]
[346.654073, "o", "------------------|\r\n    54\t| 0 | float32 | 4 |\r\n    55\t| 1 | float64 | 8 |\r\n    56\t| 2 | float16 | 2 |\r\n    57\t| 3 | int32 | 4 |\r\n    58\t| 4 | int64 | 8 |\r\n    59\t| 5 | bfloat16 | 2 |\r\n    60\t\r\n    61\t**Validation**: `DataSize` must equal `product(Shape) * element_byte_size`. If it does not match, the tensor block is malformed.\r\n    62\t\r\n    63\t### 1.3 Metadata Section\r\n"]
[346.654133, "o", "    64\t\r\n    65\tLocated at `MetadataOffset`. Contains `NumMetadata` key-value pairs:\r\n    66\t\r\n    67\t| Size | Type | Field | Description |\r\n    68\t|------|------|-------|-------------|\r\n    69\t| 2 | uint16 | KeyLen | Length of key |\r\n    70\t| KeyLen | bytes | Key | UTF-8 key string |\r\n    71\t| 4 | uint32 | ValueLen | Length of value |\r\n    72\t| ValueLen | bytes | Value | UTF-8 value (JSON-encoded) |"]
[346.65419, "o", "\r\n    73\t\r\n    74\tCommon metadata keys:\r\n    75\t- `model_name`: string, the model architecture name\r\n    76\t- `dataset`: string, training dataset identifier\r\n    77\t- `training_config`: JSON object with hyperparameters\r\n    78\t- `notes`: string, free-form notes\r\n"]
[346.654247, "o", "    79\t\r\n    80\t### 1.4 Provenance Section\r\n    81\t\r\n    82\tLocated at `ProvenanceOffset`. Fixed structure followed by variable-length fields:\r\n    83\t\r\n    84\t| Size | Type | Field | Description |\r\n    85\t|------|------|-------|-------------|\r\n    86\t| 40 | bytes | GitCommit | ASCII hex string of git commit hash (zero-padded if absent) |\r\n    87\t"]
[346.654313, "o", "| 32 | bytes | DatasetHash | Raw SHA-256 of the training dataset manifest |\r\n    88\t| 32 | bytes | ConfigHash | Raw SHA-256 of the training configuration |\r\n    89\t| 8 | int64 | TrainingTimestamp | Unix timestamp when training started |\r\n    90\t| 8 | float64 | TrainingDuration | Training duration in seconds |\r\n    91\t| 2 | uint16 | FrameworkLen | Length of framework name |\r\n    92\t| FrameworkLen | bytes | Framework | UTF-8 framework name (e.g., `PyTorch`, `JAX`) |\r\n    93\t| 2 | uint16 | FrameworkVersionLen | Length of framework version string |\r\n    94\t| FrameworkVersionLen | bytes | FrameworkVersion | UTF-8 version (e.g., `2.1.0`) |\r\n    95\t| 4 | uint32 | Epoch | Training epoch at checkpoint time |\r\n"]
[346.654375, "o", "    96\t| 8 | uint64 | GlobalStep | Global training step |\r\n    97\t| 8 | float64 | LearningRate | Learning rate at checkpoint time |\r\n    98\t| 2 | uint16 | ParentHashLen | Length of parent hash string (0 = no parent) |\r\n    99\t| ParentHashLen | bytes | ParentHash | ASCII hex SHA-256 of the parent checkpoint file (for lineage) |\r\n   100\t\r\n   101\t### 1.5 Signature Block\r\n   102\t\r\n   103\tLocated at `SignatureOffset` (only present if `Flags` bit 0 is set):\r\n   104\t\r\n   105\t| Size | Type | Field | Description |\r\n"]
[346.654434, "o", "   106\t|------|------|-------|-------------|\r\n   107\t| 1 | uint8 | Algorithm | 0 = HMAC-SHA256 |\r\n   108\t| 2 | uint16 | SignerIdLen | Length of signer identifier |\r\n   109\t| SignerIdLen | bytes | SignerId | UTF-8 signer identifier (used as HMAC key) |\r\n"]
[346.654545, "o", "   110\t| 2 | uint16 | SignatureLen | Length of signature |\r\n   111\t| SignatureLen | bytes | Signature | The signature bytes |\r\n   112\t\r\n   113\t**HMAC-SHA256 computation**: The HMAC is computed over all bytes from offset 0 to `SignatureOffset` (exclusive), using `SignerId` as the HMAC key.\r\n   114\t\r\n   115\t---\r\n   116\t\r\n   117\t## 2. Training Log Shard Format (`.jsonl`)\r\n   118\t\r\n   119\tEach `.jsonl` file contains one JSON object per line. Each object represents a training step event:\r\n   120\t\r\n"]
[346.655059, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[346.655124, "o", "root@n30009:/app# "]
