[1703.477454, "o", "docs/formats.md:24:| 0 | 4 | bytes | Magic | Must be `MLCK` (0x4D 0x4C 0x43 0x4B) |\r\ndocs/formats.md:125:  \"step\": 1000,\r\ndocs/formats.md:168:  \"model_name\": \"resnet50\",\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:15:   - Same epoch: `step_diff = next.step - curr.step > 1` AND `step_diff > 100`\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:33:- **Window**: Sliding window of 50 steps\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:35:- **Trigger**: `grad_norm > mean + 3.0 * stddev` (Z-score > 3.0)\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:36:- **Severity**: `high` if Z-score > 5.0, else `medium`\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:37:- **Required data**: At least 50 entries with `grad_norm` before detection begins\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:42:- **Window**: Sliding window of 50 steps\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:44:- **Trigger**: `(loss_end - loss_start) / |loss_start| > 1.0` (>100% increase)\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:45:- **Severity**: `critical` if increase > 5.0 (500%), else `high`\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:96:- **Trigger**: `time_diff > 7200 seconds` between consecutive entries within the same epoch\r\ndocs/analys"]
[1703.47757, "o", "is_rules.md:131:Example: `loss > 1.0 OR grad_norm > 5.0 AND epoch == 3`\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:132:Parses as: `loss > 1.0 OR (grad_norm > 5.0 AND epoch == 3)`\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:25:          \"global_step\": 5000,\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:35:        \"entries\": 500,\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:36:        \"step_range\": [0, 5000],\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:38:        \"time_range\": [\"2024-01-15T08:00:00Z\", \"2024-01-15T10:00:00Z\"]\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:44:        \"model_name\": \"resnet50\",\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:75:  \"step_range\": [0, 50000],\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:76:  \"time_range\": [\"2024-01-15T08:00:00Z\", \"2024-01-17T14:00:00Z\"],\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:80:      \"after_step\": 5000,\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:81:      \"before_step\": 5200,\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:85:      \"before_ts\": \"2024-01-15T13:00:00Z\"\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:90:      \"ts\": \"2024-01-15T08:00:00Z\",\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:109:- `gaps`: only gaps where `gap_steps > 100` within the same epoch.\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:230:      \"global_step\": 5000,\r\ndocs/output"]
[1703.477798, "o", "_schema.md:299:      \"step\": 15000,\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:111:\tfor i := 50; i < len(vals); i++ {\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:112:\t\twindow := vals[i-50 : i]\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:120:\t\tif observed > mean+3.0*std && z > 3.0 {\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:122:\t\t\tif z > 5.0 {\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:156:\tfor i := 50; i < len(lossEntries); i++ {\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:157:\t\tstartIdx := lossEntries[i-50]\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:167:\t\t\tif ratio > 5.0 {\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:236:\t\tif diff > 7200 {\r\ninternal/forensics/forensics.go:508:\t\tif diff > 100 {\r\n"]
