[1715.520798, "o", "docs/analysis_rules.md:14:4. **Gap Detection**: A gap exists when consecutive entries (after sorting) satisfy:\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:33:- **Window**: Sliding window of 50 steps\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:34:- **Method**: Compute mean and standard deviation of `grad_norm` over the window\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:35:- **Trigger**: `grad_norm > mean + 3.0 * stddev` (Z-score > 3.0)\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:36:- **Severity**: `high` if Z-score > 5.0, else `medium`\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:38:- **Output fields**: `observed`, `window_mean`, `window_stddev`, `z_score`\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:42:- **Window**: Sliding window of 50 steps\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:43:- **Method**: Compare loss at window start vs window end\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:45:- **Severity**: `critical` if increase > 5.0 (500%), else `high`\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:47:- **Output fields**: `loss_start`, `loss_end`, `increase_ratio`, `window_start_step`, `window_end_step`\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:52:- **Trigger**: `lr` increases between consecutive entries U"]
[1715.520906, "o", "NLESS:\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:60:- **Scope**: Between consecutive checkpoints (entries with `event == \"checkpoint\"` or between .mlck files sorted by epoch/step)\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:61:- **Trigger**: `acc` drops by more than 0.15 (absolute, not relative) between consecutive checkpoints\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:65:### 2.5 Checkpoint Integrity - Tensor Checksum\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:96:- **Trigger**: `time_diff > 7200 seconds` between consecutive entries within the same epoch\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:131:Example: `loss > 1.0 OR grad_norm > 5.0 AND epoch == 3`\r\ndocs/analysis_rules.md:132:Parses as: `loss > 1.0 OR (grad_norm > 5.0 AND epoch == 3)`\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:110:- Entries with missing optional fields omit them from the JSON (do not include null).\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:165:      \"type\": \"gradient_spike\",\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:171:        \"window_mean\": 1.2,\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:172:        \"window_stddev\": 0.3,\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:199:      \"gradient_spike\": 1,\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:202:   "]
[1715.521031, "o", "   \"training_gap\": 1,\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:212:- `type` values: `gradient_spike`, `loss_divergence`, `lr_anomaly`, `metric_regression`, `tensor_checksum_mismatch`, `header_checksum_mismatch`, `signature_invalid`, `provenance_chain_break`, `training_gap`, `dataset_hash_inconsistency`.\r\ndocs/spec.md:112:| 1 | Input error (missing directory, no artifacts, invalid arguments) |\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:112:\t\twindow := vals[i-50 : i]\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:113:\t\tmean := meanFloats(window)\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:114:\t\tstd := stddevFloats(window, mean)\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:120:\t\tif observed > mean+3.0*std && z > 3.0 {\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:122:\t\t\tif z > 5.0 {\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:128:\t\t\t\tType:     \"gradient_spike\",\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:134:\t\t\t\t\t\"window_mean\":   mean,\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:135:\t\t\t\t\t\"window_stddev\": std,\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:167:\t\t\tif ratio > 5.0 {\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:181:\t\t\t\t\t\"window_start_step\": entries[startIdx].Step,"]
