[1932.893448, "o", "   100\t    }\r\n   101\t  ]\r\n   102\t}\r\n   103\t```\r\n   104\t\r\n   105\t**Field rules:**\r\n   106\t- `entries`: sorted by `(epoch ASC, step ASC)`.\r\n   107\t- `sources`: list of shard filenames (basenames) that contained this `(epoch, step)`.\r\n   108\t"]
[1932.893578, "o", "- `conflict`: `true` if this entry was chosen by conflict resolution.\r\n   109\t- `gaps`: only gaps where `gap_steps > 100` within the same epoch.\r\n   110\t- Entries with missing optional fields omit them from the JSON (do not include null).\r\n   111\t\r\n   112\t---\r\n   113\t\r\n   114\t## 3. Verify Output\r\n   115\t\r\n   116\t```json\r\n   117\t{\r\n   118\t  \"status\": \"ok\",\r\n   119\t  \"checkpoints\": [\r\n   120\t    {\r\n   121\t      \"file\": \"model_epoch1.mlck\",\r\n   122\t      \"valid\": true,\r\n   123\t      \"header_checksum_valid\": true,\r\n   124\t      \"tensor_checksums_valid\": true,\r\n   125\t      \"signature_valid\": null,\r\n   126\t      \"provenance_valid\": true,\r\n"]
[1932.893665, "o", "   127\t      \"issues\": []\r\n   128\t    },\r\n   129\t    {\r\n   130\t      \"file\": \"model_epoch3.mlck\",\r\n   131\t      \"valid\": false,\r\n   132\t      \"header_checksum_valid\": true,\r\n   133\t      \"tensor_checksums_valid\": false,\r\n   134\t      \"signature_valid\": true,\r\n   135\t      \"provenance_valid\": true,\r\n   136\t      \"issues\": [\r\n   137\t        \"tensor_checksum_mismatch:encoder.layer2.weight\"\r\n   138\t      ]\r\n"]
[1932.893729, "o", "   139\t    }\r\n   140\t  ],\r\n   141\t  \"summary\": {\r\n   142\t    \"total\": 3,\r\n   143\t    \"valid\": 2,\r\n   144\t    \"invalid\": 1\r\n   145\t  }\r\n   146\t}\r\n   147\t```\r\n   148\t\r\n"]
[1932.8938, "o", "   149\t**Field rules:**\r\n   150\t- `checkpoints`: sorted by `file` name lexicographically.\r\n   151\t- `signature_valid`: `null` if the checkpoint is unsigned, `true`/`false` if signed.\r\n"]
[1932.893862, "o", "   152\t- `issues`: list of human-readable issue descriptions. Format for tensor checksum mismatch: `\"tensor_checksum_mismatch:<tensor_name>\"`.\r\n   153\t- `valid`: `true` only if all applicable checks pass.\r\n   154\t\r\n   155\t---\r\n   156\t\r\n   157\t## 4. Detect Output\r\n   158\t\r\n   159\t```json\r\n   160\t{\r\n   161\t  \"status\": \"ok\",\r\n   162\t  \"anomalies\": [\r\n   163\t    {\r\n   164\t      \"id\": \"ANOM-001\",\r\n   165\t      \"type\": \"gradient_spike\",\r\n   166\t      \"severity\": \"high\",\r\n   167\t      \"epoch\": 2,\r\n   168\t      \"step\": 3456,\r\n"]
[1932.893964, "o", "   169\t      \"details\": {\r\n   170\t        \"observed\": 15.3,\r\n   171\t        \"window_mean\": 1.2,\r\n   172\t        \"window_stddev\": 0.3,\r\n   173\t        \"z_score\": 47.0\r\n   174\t      },\r\n   175\t      \"source\": \"shard_002.jsonl\"\r\n   176\t    },\r\n   177\t    {\r\n   178\t      \"id\": \"ANOM-002\",\r\n   179\t      \"type\": \"tensor_checksum_mismatch\",\r\n"]
[1932.894043, "o", "   180\t      \"severity\": \"critical\",\r\n   181\t      \"details\": {\r\n   182\t        \"file\": \"model_epoch3.mlck\",\r\n   183\t        \"tensor_name\": \"encoder.layer2.weight\",\r\n   184\t        \"expected_checksum\": \"abcd1234...\",\r\n   185\t        \"actual_checksum\": \"efgh5678...\"\r\n   186\t      },\r\n   187\t      \"source\": \"model_epoch3.mlck\"\r\n   188\t    }\r\n   189\t  ],\r\n   190\t  \"summary\": {\r\n   191\t    \"total\": 5,\r\n   192\t    \"by_severity\": {\r\n   193\t      \"critical\": 1,\r\n   194\t      \"high\": 2,\r\n"]
[1932.894105, "o", "   195\t      \"medium\": 1,\r\n   196\t      \"low\": 1\r\n   197\t    },\r\n   198\t    \"by_type\": {\r\n   199\t      \"gradient_spike\": 1,\r\n   200\t      \"loss_divergence\": 1,\r\n   201\t      \"tensor_checksum_mismatch\": 1,\r\n   202\t      \"training_gap\": 1,\r\n   203\t      \"lr_anomaly\": 1\r\n   204\t    }\r\n"]
[1932.89417, "o", "   205\t  }\r\n   206\t}\r\n   207\t```\r\n   208\t\r\n   209\t**Field rules:**\r\n   210\t- `id`: Sequential ID in format `ANOM-NNN`, assigned in detection order.\r\n   211\t- `anomalies`: sorted by severity (critical > high > medium > low), then by step/epoch.\r\n   212\t- `type` values: `gradient_spike`, `loss_divergence`, `lr_anomaly`, `metric_regression`, `tensor_checksum_mismatch`, `header_checksum_mismatch`, `signature_invalid`, `provenance_chain_break`, `training_gap`, `dataset_hash_inconsistency`.\r\n   213\t- `details`: type-specific fields as defined in `/app/docs/analysis_rules.md`.\r\n   214\t- `source`: the artifact file where the anomaly was detected.\r\n"]
[1932.894255, "o", "   215\t- `epoch` and `step`: present only for timeline-based anomalies.\r\n   216\t- If no anomalies are detected, `anomalies` is an empty array.\r\n   217\t\r\n   218\t---\r\n"]
[1932.89439, "o", "   219\t\r\n   220\t## 5. Lineage Output\r\n   221\t\r\n   222\t```json\r\n   223\t{\r\n   224\t  \"status\": \"ok\",\r\n   225\t  \"nodes\": [\r\n   226\t    {\r\n   227\t      \"file\": \"model_epoch1.mlck\",\r\n   228\t      \"file_hash\": \"a1b2c3...\",\r\n   229\t      \"epoch\": 1,\r\n   230\t      \"global_step\": 5000,\r\n   231\t      \"creation_timestamp\": \"2024-01-15T10:00:00Z\",\r\n   232\t      \"parent_hash\": \"\",\r\n   233\t      \"is_root\": true,\r\n   234\t      \"is_leaf\": false,\r\n   235\t      \"is_orphan\": false\r\n   236\t    }\r\n   237\t  ],\r\n   238\t  \"edges\": [\r\n   239\t    {\r\n   240\t      \"from\": \"a1b2c3...\",\r\n"]
