[2935.869275, "o", "   300\t      \"epoch\": 3,\r\n   301\t      \"step\": 15000,\r\n   302\t      \"loss\": 1.234,\r\n   303\t      \"lr\": 0.0001,\r\n   304\t      \"grad_norm\": 2.1,\r\n   305\t      \"acc\": 0.75,\r\n   306\t      \"event\": \"step\",\r\n"]
[2935.869416, "o", "   307\t      \"sources\": [\"shard_003.jsonl\"],\r\n   308\t      \"conflict\": false\r\n   309\t    }\r\n   310\t  ]\r\n   311\t}\r\n   312\t```\r\n   313\t\r\n   314\t**Field rules:**\r\n"]
[2935.869507, "o", "   315\t- `entries`: matching timeline entries sorted by `(epoch ASC, step ASC)`.\r\n   316\t- `matches`: count of matching entries.\r\n   317\t- `query`: the original query string echoed back.\r\n"]
