[2943.701524, "o", "   110\t- Entries with missing optional fields omit them from the JSON (do not include null).\r\n   111\t\r\n   112\t---\r\n   113"]
[2943.701537, "o", "\t\r\n   114\t## 3. Verify Output\r\n   115\t"]
[2943.701598, "o", "\r\n"]
[2943.701709, "o", "   116\t```json\r\n   117\t{\r\n   118\t  \"status\": \"ok\",\r\n   119\t  \"checkpoints\": [\r\n   120\t    {\r\n   121\t      \"file\": \"model_epoch1.mlck\",\r\n   122\t      \"valid\": true,\r\n   123\t      \"header_checksum_valid\": true,\r\n   124\t      \"tensor_checksums_valid\": true,\r\n   125\t      \"signature_valid\": null,\r\n   126\t      \"provenance_valid\": true,\r\n   127\t      \"issues\": []\r\n   128\t    },\r\n   129\t    {\r\n   130\t      \"file\": \"model_epoch3.mlck\",\r\n   131\t      \"valid\": false,\r\n   132\t      \"header_checksum_valid\": true,\r\n   133\t      \"tensor_checksums_valid\": false,\r\n"]
[2943.701783, "o", "   134\t      \"signature_valid\": true,\r\n   135\t      \"provenance_valid\": true,\r\n   136\t      \"issues\": [\r\n   137\t        {\"type\": \"tensor_checksum_mismatch\", \"detail\": \"encoder.layer2.weight\"}\r\n   138\t      ]\r\n   139\t    }\r\n   140\t  ],\r\n   141\t  \"summary\": {\r\n   142\t    \"total\": 3,\r\n   143\t    \"valid\": 2,\r\n   144\t    \"invalid\": 1\r\n"]
[2943.701797, "o", "   145\t  }\r\n   146\t}\r\n   147\t```\r\n   148\t\r\n   149\t**Field rules:**\r\n   150\t- `checkpoints`: sorted by `file` name lexicographically.\r\n   151\t- `signature_valid`: `null` if the checkpoint is unsigned, `true`/`false` if signed.\r\n   152\t- `issues`: list of issue objects with `type` (string) and `detail` (string). For example, a tensor checksum mismatch appears as `{\"type\": \"tensor_checksum_mismatch\", \"detail\": \"<tensor_name>\"}`.\r\n   153\t- `valid`: `true` only if all applicable checks pass.\r\n   154\t\r\n   155\t---\r\n   156\t\r\n   157\t## 4. Detect Output\r\n"]
[2943.701898, "o", "   158\t\r\n   159\t```json\r\n   160\t{\r\n   161\t  \"status\": \"ok\",\r\n   162\t  \"anomalies\": [\r\n   163\t    {\r\n   164\t      \"id\": \"ANOM-001\",\r\n   165\t      \"type\": \"gradient_spike\",\r\n   166\t      \"severity\": \"high\",\r\n   167\t      \"epoch\": 2,\r\n   168\t      \"step\": 3456,\r\n   169\t      \"details\": {\r\n   170\t        \"observed\": 15.3,\r\n   171"]
[2943.701911, "o", "\t        \"window_mean\": 1.2,\r\n   172\t        \"window_stddev\": 0.3,\r\n"]
[2943.702043, "o", "   173\t        \"z_score\": 47.0\r\n   174\t      },\r\n   175\t      \"source\": \"shard_002.jsonl\"\r\n"]
[2943.702056, "o", "   176\t    },\r\n   177\t    {\r\n   178\t      \"id\": \"ANOM-002\",\r\n   179\t      \"type\": \"tensor_checksum_mismatch\",\r\n   180\t      \"severity\": \"critical\",\r\n   181\t      \"details\": {\r\n   182\t        \"file\": \"model_epoch3.mlck\",\r\n   183\t        \"tensor_name\": \"encoder.layer2.weight\",\r\n   184\t        \"expected_checksum\": \"abcd1234...\",\r\n   185\t        \"actual_checksum\": \"efgh5678...\"\r\n   186\t      },\r\n   187\t      \"source\": \"model_epoch3.mlck\",\r\n   188\t        \"checkpoint\": \"model_epoch3.mlck\"\r\n   189\t    }\r\n   190\t  ],\r\n"]
