[3065.876124, "o", "    {\r\n      \"ts\": \"2024-01-16T08:00:00Z\",\r\n      \"epoch\": 3,\r\n      \"step\": 15000,\r\n      \"loss\": 1.234,\r\n      \"lr\": 0.0001,\r\n      \"grad_norm\": 2.1,\r\n      \"acc\": 0.75,\r\n      \"event\": \"step\",\r\n      \"sources\": [\"shard_003.jsonl\"],\r\n      \"conflict\": false\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Field rules:**\r\n- `entries`: matching timeline entries sorted by `(epoch ASC, step ASC)`.\r\n- `matches`: count of matching entries.\r\n- `query`: the original query string echoed back.\r\n"]
