[3402.321059, "o", "\r\n\r\n## 8. Diff Output\r\n\r\n"]
[3402.321155, "o", "```json\r\n{\r\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\r\n  \"file_a\": \"model_epoch1.mlck\",\r\n  \"file_b\": \"model_epoch2.mlck\",\r\n  \"tensor_diffs\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"layer1.weight\",\r\n      \"shape_match\": true,\r\n      \"shape_a\": [4, 3],\r\n      \"shape_b\": [4, 3],\r\n      \"max_abs_diff\": 1.234,\r\n      \"mean_abs_diff\": 0.567\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"layer2.bias\",\r\n"]
[3402.32125, "o", "      \"shape_match\": false,\r\n      \"shape_a\": [3],\r\n      \"shape_b\": [6]\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"layer3.weight\",\r\n      \"shape_match\": false,\r\n      \"shape_a\": null,\r\n      \"shape_b\": [2, 2]\r\n    }\r\n"]
[3402.321317, "o", "  ],\r\n  \"summary\": {\r\n    \"total_tensors_a\": 2,\r\n    \"total_tensors_b\": 3,\r\n    \"common_tensors\": 2,\r\n    \"shape_mismatches\": 1,\r\n    \"only_in_a\": [],\r\n    \"only_in_b\": [\"layer3.weight\"]\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Field rules:**\r\n- `file_a` and `file_b` are the basenames of `file1` and `file2`.\r\n- `tensor_diffs`: sorted by tensor name lexicographically.\r\n- `shape_a` and `shape_b`: tensor shapes from each file, or `null` if absent from that file.\r\n- `shape_match`: `true` only when the tensor exists in both files and the shapes are identical.\r\n- `max_abs_diff` and `mean_abs_diff`: present only for tensors with `shape_match: true`, computed over float32 element-wise absolute differences.\r\n- `summary.total_tensors_a` and `summary.total_tensors_b`: tensor counts in each file.\r\n- `summary.common_tensors`: number of tensor names present in both files.\r\n- `summary.shape_mismatches`: number of common tensors with different shapes.\r\n- `summary.only_in_a` and `summary.only_in_b`: tensor names present in only one file, sorted lex"]
[3402.321388, "o", "icographically.\r\n"]
[3402.321803, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[3402.321859, "o", "root@n30009:/app# "]
