[3433.314176, "o", "docs/spec.md:101:#### `diff`\r\ndocs/spec.md:104:mlforge diff <evidence-dir> <file1> <file2>\r\ndocs/spec.md:109:For every tensor name present in either file, include one entry in `tensor_diffs`, sorted by tensor name lexicographically. `max_abs_diff` and `mean_abs_diff` are included only when both files contain the tensor and their shapes match.\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:327:  \"tensor_diffs\": [\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:333:      \"max_abs_diff\": 1.234,\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:334:      \"mean_abs_diff\": 0.567\r\ndocs/output_schema.md:362:- `tensor_diffs`: sorted by tensor name lexicographically.\r\n"]
