[5185.60159, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[5185.601659, "o", "```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[5185.601737, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[5185.601869, "o", "**Field rules:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[5185.601931, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[5185.602405, "o", "- `id`: Sequential ID in format `ANOM-NNN`, assigned in detection order.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[5185.602465, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[5185.602885, "o", "- `anomalies`: sorted by severity (critical > high > medium > low), then by step/epoch.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[5185.602961, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[5185.603976, "o", "- `type` values: `gradient_spike`, `loss_divergence`, `lr_anomaly`, `metric_regression`, `tensor_checksum_mismatch`, `header_checksum_mismatch`, `signature_invalid`, `provenance_chain_break`, `training_gap`, `dataset_hash_inconsistency`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[5185.604053, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[5185.604346, "o", "- `details`: type-specific fields as defined in `/app/docs/analysis_rules.md`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[5185.604415, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[5185.604643, "o", "- `source`: the artifact file where the anomaly was detected.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[5185.604709, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[5185.604961, "o", "- `epoch` and `step`: present only for timeline-based anomalies.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[5185.605031, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[5185.605627, "o", "- `checkpoint`: present when the anomaly is related to a specific checkpoint file; omitted for timeline-based anomalies that are not checkpoint-specific.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[5185.605694, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[5185.605942, "o", "- If no anomalies are detected, `anomalies` is an empty array.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[5185.60601, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> '''\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
