[6081.150789, "o", "## 2. Anomaly Detection Rules\r\n\r\nAnomalies are classified by severity: `critical`, `high`, `medium`, `low`, `info`.\r\n\r\n### 2.1 Gradient Norm Spike\r\n\r\n- **Window**: Sliding window of 50 steps\r\n"]
[6081.15131, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[6081.151386, "o", "root@n30009:/app# "]
[6081.429253, "i", "python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np = Path('docs/analysis_rules.md')\ns = p.read_text()\nold = 'Anomalies are classified by severity: `critical`, `high`, `medium`, `low`, `info`.'\nnew = old + '\\n\\nSeverity order, from most severe to least severe, is `critical` > `high` > `medium` > `low` > `info`. Anomalies are sorted by severity, then `type` alphabetically, then `epoch` ascending, then `step` ascending.'\nif 'Severity order, from most severe to least severe' not in s:\n    s = s.replace(old, new, 1)\np.write_text(s)\nPY\n"]
[6081.42951, "o", "python3 - <<'PY'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
