[6089.011662, "o", "; `info` returns all severities.\r\ndocs/spec.md:80:- `--filter-severity LEVEL`: filter anomalies to show only those at the specified severity level or above. Severity order is `critical > high > medium > low > info`. For example, `--filter-severity high` shows only `critical` and `high` anomalies, while `--filter-severity critical` shows only `critical` anomalies. The returned JSON summary reflects the filtered anomaly list.\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:255:\t\t\t\tSeverity: \"info\",\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:290:\t\t\t\tSeverity: \"info\",\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:329:\t\t\t\tSeverity: \"high\",\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:423:\t\t\t\t\tSeverity: \"medium\",\r\ninternal/forensics/detect.go:507:\t\t\t\tSeverity: \"high\",\r\n"]
