[6520.609823, "o", "new = \"\"\"### 2.1 Gradient Norm Spike\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6520.609889, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6520.609948, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6520.610507, "o", "- **Method**: Exponential Weighted Moving Average (EWMA) over `grad_norm` values in timeline order\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6520.610574, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6520.610953, "o", "- **Parameters**: `alpha = 0.1`; tracks EWMA mean and EWMA variance\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6520.611021, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6520.611377, "o", "- **Warmup**: At least 30 entries with `grad_norm` before detection begins\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6520.611444, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6520.611822, "o", "- **Trigger**: `z_score > 2.5`, where `z_score = (grad_norm - ewma_mean) / ewma_stddev`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6520.61189, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6520.61217, "o", "- **Severity**: `high` when `z_score > 4.0`, otherwise `medium`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6520.612234, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6520.612551, "o", "- **Output fields**: `observed`, `ewma_mean`, `ewma_stddev`, `z_score`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6520.612613, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6520.612957, "o", "- **Evidence**: `window_values` contains up to 5 preceding `grad_norm` values\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6520.613023, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6520.613074, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6520.61317, "o", "### 2.2 Loss Divergence\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
