[6520.613274, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6520.613643, "o", "- **Method**: Exponential Moving Average (EMA) over `loss` values in timeline order\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6520.613706, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6520.613854, "o", "- **Parameters**: `alpha = 0.05`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6520.613915, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6520.614124, "o", "- **Trigger**: `current_loss > 2.0 * ema_loss`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
