[6545.868514, "o", "   144\tfunc detectGradientSpikes(entries []types.TimelineEntry) []types.Anomaly {\r\n   145\t\tvar vals []float64\r\n   146\t\tvar idx []int\r\n   147\t\tfor i, e := range entries {\r\n   148\t"]
[6545.86861, "o", "\t\tif e.GradNorm != nil {\r\n   149\t\t\t\tvals = append(vals, *e.GradNorm)\r\n   150\t\t\t\tidx = append(idx, i)\r\n   151\t\t\t}\r\n   152\t\t}\r\n   153\t\tif len(vals) < 31 {\r\n   154\t\t\treturn nil\r\n   155\t\t}\r\n   156\t\tvar anomalies []types.Anomaly\r\n   157\t\tfor i := 30; i < len(vals); i++ {\r\n   158\t\t\twindow := vals[i-30 : i]\r\n   159\t\t\tmean := meanFloats(window)\r\n   160\t\t\tstd := stddevFloats(window, mean)\r\n"]
[6545.86869, "o", "   161\t\t\tobserved := vals[i]\r\n   162\t\t\tz := 0.0\r\n   163\t\t\tif std > 0 {\r\n   164\t\t\t\tz = (observed - mean) / std\r\n   165\t\t\t}\r\n   166\t\t\tif observed > mean+2.5*std && z > 2.5 {\r\n   167\t\t\t\tseverity := \"medium\"\r\n   168\t\t\t\tif z > 4.0 {\r\n   169\t\t\t\t\tseverity = \"high\"\r\n   170\t\t\t\t}\r\n"]
[6545.868755, "o", "   171\t\t\t\tep := entries[idx[i]].Epoch\r\n   172\t\t\t\tst := entries[idx[i]].Step\r\n   173\t\t\t\tanomalies = append(anomalies, types.Anomaly{\r\n   174\t\t\t\t\tType:     \"gradient_spike\",\r\n   175\t\t\t\t\tSeverity: severity,\r\n   176\t\t\t\t\tEpoch:    &ep,\r\n   177\t\t\t\t\tStep:     &st,\r\n   178\t\t\t\t\tDetails: map[string]interface{}{\r\n"]
[6545.868818, "o", "   179\t\t\t\t\t\t\"observed\":      observed,\r\n   180\t\t\t\t\t\t\"window_mean\":   mean,\r\n   181\t\t\t\t\t\t\"window_stddev\": std,\r\n   182\t\t\t\t\t\t\"z_score\":       z,\r\n   183\t\t\t\t\t},\r\n   184\t\t\t\t\tEvidence: map[string]interface{}{\"window_values\": lastValues(window, 5)},\r\n   185\t\t\t\t\tSource:   firstSource(entries[idx[i]]),\r\n   186\t"]
[6545.868887, "o", "\t\t\t})\r\n   187\t\t\t}\r\n   188\t\t}\r\n   189\t\treturn anomalies\r\n   190\t}\r\n   191\t\r\n"]
[6545.868969, "o", "   192\tfunc detectLossDivergence(entries []types.TimelineEntry) []types.Anomaly {\r\n   193\t\tvar lossEntries []int\r\n   194\t\tfor i, e := range entries {\r\n   195\t\t\tif e.Loss != nil {\r\n   196\t\t\t\tlossEntries = append(lossEntries, i)\r\n   197\t\t\t}\r\n   198\t\t}\r\n   199\t\tif len(lossEntries) < 51 {\r\n   200\t\t\treturn nil\r\n   201\t\t}\r\n   202\t\tvar anomalies []types.Anomaly\r\n   203\t\tfor i := 50; i < len(lossEntries); i++ {\r\n   204\t\t\tstartIdx := lossEntries[i-50]\r\n   205\t\t"]
[6545.869033, "o", "\tendIdx := lossEntries[i]\r\n   206\t\t\tstart := *entries[startIdx].Loss\r\n   207\t\t\tend := *entries[endIdx].Loss\r\n   208\t\t\tif math.Abs(start) <= 1e-6 {\r\n   209\t\t\t\tcontinue\r\n   210\t\t\t}\r\n   211\t\t\tratio := (end - start) / math.Abs(start)\r\n   212\t\t\tif ratio > 1.0 {\r\n   213\t\t\t\tseverity := \"high\"\r\n   214\t\t\t\tif ratio > 5.0 {\r\n   215"]
[6545.869095, "o", "\t\t\t\t\tseverity = \"critical\"\r\n   216\t\t\t\t}\r\n   217\t\t\t\tep := entries[endIdx].Epoch\r\n   218\t\t\t\tst := entries[endIdx].Step\r\n"]
[6545.869153, "o", "   219\t\t\t\tanomalies = append(anomalies, types.Anomaly{\r\n   220\t\t\t\t\tType:     \"loss_divergence\",\r\n   221\t\t\t\t\tSeverity: severity,\r\n   222\t\t\t\t\tEpoch:    &ep,\r\n   223\t\t\t\t\tStep:     &st,\r\n   224\t\t\t\t\tDetails: map[string]interface{}{\r\n   225\t\t\t\t\t\t\"loss_start\":        start,\r\n   226\t\t\t\t\t\t\"loss_end\":          end,\r\n   227\t\t\t\t\t\t\"increase_ratio\":    ratio,\r\n   228\t\t\t\t\t\t\"window_start_step\": entries[startIdx].Step,\r\n   229\t\t\t"]
[6545.869212, "o", "\t\t\t\"window_end_step\":   entries[endIdx].Step,\r\n   230\t\t\t\t\t},\r\n   231\t\t\t\t\tEvidence: map[string]interface{}{\"window_values\": precedingLossValues(entries, lossEntries, i, 5)},\r\n   232\t\t\t\t\tSource:   firstSource(entries[endIdx]),\r\n   233\t\t\t\t})\r\n   234\t\t\t}\r\n   235\t\t}\r\n   236\t\treturn anomalies\r\n   237"]
[6545.869274, "o", "\t}\r\n   238\t\r\n   239\tfunc detectLrAnomalies(entries []types.TimelineEntry) []types.Anomaly {\r\n   240\t\tvar anomalies []types.Anomaly\r\n   241\t\tfor i := 1; i < len(entries); i++ {\r\n   242\t\t\tprev := entries[i-1]\r\n   243\t\t\tcur := entries[i]\r\n   244\t\t\tif prev.Lr == nil || cur.Lr == nil {\r\n   245\t\t\t\tcontinue\r\n"]
[6545.869784, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@n30009:/app# "]
[6546.163109, "i", "nl -ba docs/analysis_rules.md | sed -n '25,55p'\n"]
[6546.163305, "o", "nl -ba docs/analysis_rules.md | sed -n '25,55p'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6546.166746, "o", "    25\t---\r\n    26\t\r\n    27"]
[6546.166814, "o", "\t## 2. Anomaly Detection Rules\r\n    28\t\r\n    29\tAnomalies are classified by severity: `critical`, `high`, `medium`, `low`, `info`.\r\n    30\t\r\n    31\tSeverity order, from most severe to least severe, is `critical` > `high` > `medium` > `low` > `info`. Anomalies are sorted by severity, then `type` alphabetically, then `epoch` ascending, then `step` ascending.\r\n    32\t\r\n    33\t### 2.1 Gradient Norm Spike\r\n    34\t\r\n    35\t- **Window**: Sliding window of 50 steps\r\n"]
[6546.166878, "o", "    36\t- **Method**: Compute mean and standard deviation of `grad_norm` over the window\r\n    37\t- **Trigger**: `grad_norm > mean + 3.0 * stddev` (Z-score > 3.0)\r\n    38\t- **Severity**: `high` if Z-score > 5.0, else `medium`\r\n    39\t- **Required data**: At least 50 entries with `grad_norm` before detection begins\r\n    40\t- **Output fields**: `observed`, `window_mean`, `window_stddev`, `z_score`\r\n    41\t\r\n    42\t### 2.2 Loss Divergence\r\n    43\t\r\n    44\t- **Window**: Sliding window of 50 steps\r\n"]
[6546.166971, "o", "    45\t- **Method**: Compare loss at window start vs window end\r\n    46\t- **Trigger**: `(loss_end - loss_start) / |loss_start| > 1.0` (>100% increase)\r\n    47\t- **Severity**: `critical` if increase > 5.0 (500%), else `high`\r\n    48\t- **Guard**: Only trigger if `|loss_start| > 1e-6` (avoid division by near-zero)\r\n    49\t- **Output fields**: `loss_start`, `loss_end`, `increase_ratio`, `window_start_step`, `window_end_step`\r\n    50\t\r\n    51\t### 2.3 Learning Rate Anomaly\r\n    52\t\r\n    53\t- **Method**: Analyze the sequence of `lr` values across sorted timeline\r\n    54\t"]
[6546.167027, "o", "- **Trigger**: `lr` increases between consecutive entries UNLESS:\r\n    55\t  - The increase coincides with an `epoch_end` event (warmup restart pattern)\r\n"]
[6546.167433, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@n30009:/app# "]
[6546.449209, "i", "nl -ba docs/output_schema.md | sed -n '155,180p'\n"]
[6546.449443, "o", "nl -ba docs/output_schema.md | sed -n '155,180p'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6546.452669, "o", "   155\t---\r\n   156\t\r\n   157\t## 4. Detect Output\r\n   158\t\r\n   159\t```json\r\n"]
[6546.452867, "o", "   160\t{\r\n   161\t  \"status\": \"ok\",\r\n   162\t  \"anomalies\": [\r\n   163\t    {\r\n   164\t      \"id\": \"ANOM-001\",\r\n   165\t      \"type\": \"gradient_spike\",\r\n   166\t      \"severity\": \"high\",\r\n   167\t      \"epoch\": 2,\r\n   168\t      \"step\": 3456,\r\n   169\t      \"details\": {\r\n   170\t        \"observed\": 15.3,\r\n   171\t        \"window_mean\": 1.2,\r\n   172\t        \"window_stddev\": 0.3,\r\n   173\t        \"z_score\": 47.0\r\n   174\t      },\r\n   175\t      \"evidence\": {\r\n   176\t        \"window_values\": [1.1, 1.3, 1.0, 1.2, 1.4]\r\n   177\t      },\r\n   178\t      \"source\": \"shard_002.jsonl\"\r\n   179\t    },\r\n   180\t    {\r\n"]
[6546.453324, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@n30009:/app# "]
[6584.481524, "i", "python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport re\n\n# Update analysis_rules.md sections 2.1 and 2.2\ndp = Path(\"docs/analysis_rules.md\")\nds = dp.read_text()\npattern = r\"### 2\\.1 Gradient Norm Spike\\n\\n.*?\\n\\n### 2\\.3 Learning Rate Anomaly\"\nreplacement = \"\"\"### 2.1 Gradient Norm Spike\n\n- **Method**: Exponential Weighted Moving Average (EWMA) over `grad_norm` values in timeline order\n- **Parameters**: `alpha = 0.1`; tracks EWMA mean and EWMA variance\n- **Warmup**: At least 30 entries with `grad_norm` before detection begins\n- **Trigger**: `z_score > 2.5`, where `z_score = (grad_norm - ewma_mean) / ewma_stddev`\n- **Severity**: `high` when `z_score > 4.0`, otherwise `medium`\n- **Output fields**: `observed`, `ewma_mean`, `ewma_stddev`, `z_score`\n- **Evidence**: `window_values` contains up to 5 preceding `grad_norm` values\n\n### 2.2 Loss Divergence\n\n- **Method**: Exponential Moving Average (EMA) over `loss` values in timeline order\n- **Parameters**: `alpha = 0.05`\n- **Trigger**: `current_loss > 2.0 * ema_loss`\n- **G"]
[6584.481817, "i", "uard**: Ignore detection when `abs(ema_loss) <= 1e-6`\n- **Severity**: `critical` when `current_loss / ema_loss > 5.0`, otherwise `high`\n- **Output fields**: `current_loss`, `ema_loss`, `ratio`\n- **Evidence**: `window_values` contains up to 5 preceding `loss` values\n\n### 2.3 Learning Rate Anomaly\"\"\"\nnew_ds, n = re.subn(pattern, replacement, ds, count=1, flags=re.S)\nif n != 1:\n    raise SystemExit(f\"analysis_rules.md replacement count={n}\")\ndp.write_text(new_ds)\n\n# Update output_schema.md example fields for consistency\nop = Path(\"docs/output_schema.md\")\nos_text = op.read_text()\nos_text = os_text.replace('\"window_mean\": 1.2,', '\"ewma_mean\": 1.2,')\nos_text = os_text.replace('\"window_stddev\": 0.3,', '\"ewma_stddev\": 0.3,')\nop.write_text(os_text)\nPY\n"]
[6584.481922, "o", "python3 - <<'PY'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
