[6584.483114, "o", "# Update analysis_rules.md sections 2.1 and 2.2\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.483181, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6584.483382, "o", "dp = Path(\"docs/analysis_rules.md\")\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.483432, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6584.483557, "o", "ds = dp.read_text()\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.483606, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6584.484117, "o", "pattern = r\"### 2\\.1 Gradient Norm Spike\\n\\n.*?\\n\\n### 2\\.3 Learning Rate Anomaly\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.484185, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[6584.484241, "o", "> "]
[6584.484443, "o", "replacement = \"\"\"### 2.1 Gradient Norm Spike\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.484491, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n"]
[6584.484557, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6584.485137, "o", "- **Method**: Exponential Weighted Moving Average (EWMA) over `grad_norm` values in timeline order\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.485197, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6584.485589, "o", "- **Parameters**: `alpha = 0.1`; tracks EWMA mean and EWMA variance\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.485636, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6584.48608, "o", "- **Warmup**: At least 30 entries with `grad_norm` before detection begins\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.486145, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6584.486634, "o", "- **Trigger**: `z_score > 2.5`, where `z_score = (grad_norm - ewma_mean) / ewma_stddev`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.486682, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[6584.486736, "o", "> "]
[6584.48707, "o", "- **Severity**: `high` when `z_score > 4.0`, otherwise `medium`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.487142, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6584.487531, "o", "- **Output fields**: `observed`, `ewma_mean`, `ewma_stddev`, `z_score`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.487578, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6584.488049, "o", "- **Evidence**: `window_values` contains up to 5 preceding `grad_norm` values\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.488106, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.48816, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6584.488303, "o", "### 2.2 Loss Divergence\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.488365, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.488412, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6584.488914, "o", "- **Method**: Exponential Moving Average (EMA) over `loss` values in timeline order\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.488986, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6584.489177, "o", "- **Parameters**: `alpha = 0.05`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.489237, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6584.489521, "o", "- **Trigger**: `current_loss > 2.0 * ema_loss`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.489585, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6584.489916, "o", "- **Guard**: Ignore detection when `abs(ema_loss) <= 1e-6`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.48999, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[6584.490046, "o", "> "]
[6584.490453, "o", "- **Severity**: `critical` when `current_loss / ema_loss > 5.0`, otherwise `high`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.490529, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[6584.490583, "o", "> "]
[6584.490872, "o", "- **Output fields**: `current_loss`, `ema_loss`, `ratio`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.49092, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6584.491365, "o", "- **Evidence**: `window_values` contains up to 5 preceding `loss` values\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.491433, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n"]
[6584.491488, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6584.491777, "o", "### 2.3 Learning Rate Anomaly\"\"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[6584.491891, "o", "> "]
[6584.492179, "o", "new_ds, n = re.subn(pattern, replacement, ds, count=1, flags=re.S)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.49224, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[6584.492327, "o", "if n != 1:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6584.492386, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
