[6585.480488, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6585.484122, "o", "    30\t\r\n    31\tSeverity order, from most severe to least severe, is `critical` > `high` > `medium` > `low` > `info`. Anomalies are sorted by severity, then `type` alphabetically, then `epoch` ascending, then `step` ascending.\r\n    32\t\r\n    33\t### 2.1 Gradient Norm Spike\r\n    34\t\r\n    35\t- **Method**: Exponential Weighted Moving Average (EWMA) over `grad_norm` values in timeline order\r\n"]
[6585.484233, "o", "    36\t- **Parameters**: `alpha = 0.1`; tracks EWMA mean and EWMA variance\r\n    37\t- **Warmup**: At least 30 entries with `grad_norm` before detection begins\r\n    38\t- **Trigger**: `z_score > 2.5`, where `z_score = (grad_norm - ewma_mean) / ewma_stddev`\r\n    39\t- **Severity**: `high` when `z_score > 4.0`, otherwise `medium`\r\n    40\t- **Output fields**: `observed`, `ewma_mean`, `ewma_stddev`, `z_score`\r\n    41\t- **Evidence**: `window_values` contains up to 5 preceding `grad_norm` values\r\n    42\t\r\n    43\t### 2.2 Loss Divergence\r\n    44\t\r\n    45\t- **Method**: Exponential Moving Average (EMA) over `loss` values in timeline order\r\n    46\t- **Parameters**: `alpha = 0.05`\r\n    47\t- **Trigger**: `current_loss > 2.0 * ema_loss`\r\n    48\t- **Guard**: Ignore detection when `abs(ema_loss) <= 1e-6`\r\n    49\t- **Severity**: `critical` when `current_loss / ema_loss > 5.0`, otherwise `high`\r\n    50\t- **Output fields**: `current_loss`, `ema_loss`, `ratio`\r\n    51\t- **Evidence**: `window_values` contains up to 5 preceding `loss`"]
[6585.484298, "o", " values\r\n    52\t\r\n    53\t### 2.3 Learning Rate Anomaly\r\n    54\t\r\n    55\t- **Method**: Analyze the sequence of `lr` values across sorted timeline\r\n"]
